{"parse": {"title": "FP-06", "pageid": 64903, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/FP-05\" title=\"FP-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">FP-06</span><a href=\"/wiki/FP-07\" title=\"FP-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">FP</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">06</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E2.80.9C.E8.8A.B1.E7.AB.A5.E2.80.9D\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"“花童”\">“花童”</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> “花童”</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">\"Flower Child\"</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>我<span class=\"color-value\"></span>们<span class=\"color-value\"></span>要<span class=\"color-value\"></span>相<span class=\"color-value\"></span>信<span class=\"color-value\"></span>“<span class=\"color-value\"></span>相<span class=\"color-value\"></span>信<span class=\"color-value\"></span>”<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>力<span class=\"color-value\"></span>量<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 191606</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>海岸边的骚动引来了追随者的注目。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"503101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-503101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-503101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"503101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-503101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-503101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-503101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-503101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">重塑追随者Ⅰ：</div><div>嘿——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他掏出了手枪，瞄准了苏菲亚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"503101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-503101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-503101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"503101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-503101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-503101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-503101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-503101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">重塑追随者Ⅰ：</div><div>我警告你别乱动，子弹可不长眼睛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她轻轻地叹了一口气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>果然。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>无理数生来就是无理数……这是不可逾越的鸿沟。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_1_at_ys_wajueyishu.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_1_at_ys_wajueyishu\"><img alt=\"2_1_at_ys_wajueyishu\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/Cg-2_1_at_ys_wajueyishu.png/600px-Cg-2_1_at_ys_wajueyishu.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/Cg-2_1_at_ys_wajueyishu.png/900px-Cg-2_1_at_ys_wajueyishu.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/Cg-2_1_at_ys_wajueyishu.png/1200px-Cg-2_1_at_ys_wajueyishu.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>挖掘艺术站起了身，他处于枪支和苏菲亚的中点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>噢……拜托，我真是受够你们的分类学了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>整数、分数、有理数、无理数、实数、虚数……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>所有的生物里，只有人会对自己的族群进行如此事无巨细的分类……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>红发的少女沉默了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>噢！我并不是想否定你们。你们这里没有战争，已经比岛外的世界好上太多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>在岛外的世界里也盛行着分类学。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>颅相学、面相学、血统论……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>每一个标准都划分出“生而优越”的阶级，他们似乎理所应当享有更多的权力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>——但这一切只是一个谎言！一个人为编造的、可恨至极的谎言！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>……我们本应亲如手足，无论是岛屿上的人，还是从外界来的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>真正的巴别塔……是人们亲手造就的社会阶级——这个庞大而井井有条的组织本身……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>我们应当反对这一切！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"503101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-503101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-503101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"503101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-503101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-503101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-503101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-503101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">重塑追随者Ⅰ：</div><div>白痴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"503101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-503101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-503101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"503101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-503101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-503101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-503101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-503101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">重塑追随者Ⅰ：</div><div>这是发表演讲的时候吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"503101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-503101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-503101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"503101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-503101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-503101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-503101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-503101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">重塑追随者Ⅰ：</div><div>你得抓住她的手……防止她用出神秘学的术式！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>朋友，我们所追寻的答案就在风中飘荡……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他将袖间的玫瑰插入了枪管。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>不同肤色的人，不同语言的人，在不同文明中长大的人……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>很多东西并非经由我们的选择而产生——这不应该成为隔阂！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>因为，我们都在同一个世界中诞生，又会在同一个世界中死去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>祝您拥有爱与和平，我的兄弟、姐妹们……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>朋友，不要使用这把泡水的手枪……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他的言语中充满担忧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>它有炸膛的风险。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508312.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-508312.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508312.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508312.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-508312.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508312.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-508312.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508312.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>@</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>从天而降的几何体束缚住了他的四肢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306417.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-306417.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306417.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306417.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-306417.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306417.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-306417.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306417.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>为什么……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>为什么宣扬爱与和平的道路如此坎坷？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它本不应如此。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306417.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-306417.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306417.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306417.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-306417.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306417.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-306417.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306417.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>从英国到法国，再从法国来到小岛，我说了这么多……可为什么这些话语毫无作用……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306417.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-306417.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306417.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306417.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-306417.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306417.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-306417.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306417.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>我究竟要做什么，才能让冲突与纷争远离这个世界？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>你的传道十分精彩。在某个瞬间，我的意志松动了，一度想要相信你所描述的世界。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>正是这样，才令我感到害怕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>修辞的矫饰，常常会掩盖本质——这是学派告诉我的道理，如今我把它转告给你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306417.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-306417.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306417.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306417.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-306417.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306417.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-306417.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306417.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>你是说……我做得还不够多吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>红发少女并未给出他所期望的答案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>抱歉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……关于这个炸弹，我会上报领袖，让他来作出相关的裁决。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>在裁决作出之前，你和你的同伴不会受到任何的伤害。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-at_xiangzhuang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"at_xiangzhuang\"><img alt=\"at_xiangzhuang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/Cg-at_xiangzhuang.png/600px-Cg-at_xiangzhuang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/Cg-at_xiangzhuang.png/900px-Cg-at_xiangzhuang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/Cg-at_xiangzhuang.png/1200px-Cg-at_xiangzhuang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-at_tongfengguandao.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"at_tongfengguandao\"><img alt=\"at_tongfengguandao\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/Cg-at_tongfengguandao.png/600px-Cg-at_tongfengguandao.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/Cg-at_tongfengguandao.png/900px-Cg-at_tongfengguandao.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/Cg-at_tongfengguandao.png/1200px-Cg-at_tongfengguandao.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-at_congtianerjiang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"at_congtianerjiang\"><img alt=\"at_congtianerjiang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/Cg-at_congtianerjiang.png/600px-Cg-at_congtianerjiang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/Cg-at_congtianerjiang.png/900px-Cg-at_congtianerjiang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/Cg-at_congtianerjiang.png/1200px-Cg-at_congtianerjiang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-cg_fanpaidalaomen.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"cg_fanpaidalaomen\"><img alt=\"cg_fanpaidalaomen\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/Cg-cg_fanpaidalaomen.png/600px-Cg-cg_fanpaidalaomen.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/Cg-cg_fanpaidalaomen.png/900px-Cg-cg_fanpaidalaomen.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/Cg-cg_fanpaidalaomen.png/1200px-Cg-cg_fanpaidalaomen.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-at_wajueyishucaijiqiren2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"at_wajueyishucaijiqiren2\"><img alt=\"at_wajueyishucaijiqiren2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/84/Cg-at_wajueyishucaijiqiren2.png/600px-Cg-at_wajueyishucaijiqiren2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/84/Cg-at_wajueyishucaijiqiren2.png/900px-Cg-at_wajueyishucaijiqiren2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/84/Cg-at_wajueyishucaijiqiren2.png/1200px-Cg-at_wajueyishucaijiqiren2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-at_wajueyishucaijiqiren1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"at_wajueyishucaijiqiren1\"><img alt=\"at_wajueyishucaijiqiren1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7c/Cg-at_wajueyishucaijiqiren1.png/600px-Cg-at_wajueyishucaijiqiren1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7c/Cg-at_wajueyishucaijiqiren1.png/900px-Cg-at_wajueyishucaijiqiren1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7c/Cg-at_wajueyishucaijiqiren1.png/1200px-Cg-at_wajueyishucaijiqiren1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-at_wajueyishucaijiqiren1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"at_wajueyishucaijiqiren1\"><img alt=\"at_wajueyishucaijiqiren1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7c/Cg-at_wajueyishucaijiqiren1.png/600px-Cg-at_wajueyishucaijiqiren1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7c/Cg-at_wajueyishucaijiqiren1.png/900px-Cg-at_wajueyishucaijiqiren1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7c/Cg-at_wajueyishucaijiqiren1.png/1200px-Cg-at_wajueyishucaijiqiren1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><i>在神秘术的作用下，</i><br /><br /><i>他逐渐失去了意识，眼前的光芒闪烁变幻，</i><br /><br /><i>一幕幕影像随之出现。</i><br /><br /><i>他似乎沉溺在了灵性的水流之中，</i><br /><br /><i>无声的海岸上，夕阳收起了最后一抹余晖……</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-616301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-616301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-616301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">报童：</div><div>大新闻！今日特大新闻！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-616301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-616301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-616301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">报童：</div><div>美国面临最严重的征兵危机，“医学矫正征兵方案”或将推行！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306411.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-306411.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306411.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306411.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-306411.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306411.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-306411.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306411.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>……今天的报纸编辑部在进行怀旧吗？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-shezhengjie.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"shezhengjie\"><img alt=\"shezhengjie\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-shezhengjie.png/600px-Cg-shezhengjie.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-shezhengjie.png/900px-Cg-shezhengjie.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-shezhengjie.png/1200px-Cg-shezhengjie.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>天哪……是摄政街！我又回到了这里！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>可我不应该在小岛上吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>是神秘术的副作用？一个有关回忆的梦？……还是说，我已经死了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615320.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-615320.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615320.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615320.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-615320.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615320.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-615320.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615320.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>死了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>熟悉的声音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他转过头，看向声音的发源地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>噢——伦纳德先生……您获得了假释？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伦纳德·埃文斯是赫赫有名的慈善骗子，他此刻理应在监狱中服刑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>挖掘艺术也是受害者之一——但他显然还没有意识到这一点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-615301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-615301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-615301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伦纳德：</div><div>您的幽默感令人始料不及。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-615301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-615301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-615301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伦纳德：</div><div>三分钟之前，您还为自己不能捐太多的款而感到内疚……我正要告诉您，不论数目的多少，善心总是可贵的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>……三分钟之前？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他想起来了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>没错！我正要好好地和您说这件事……您会亲自把那些物资送到受难者的手中吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-615301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-615301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-615301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伦纳德：</div><div>当然，您尽可以相信我——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>好，好极了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他摸了摸口袋，露出为难的神色。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-615301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-615301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-615301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伦纳德：</div><div>没有现金的话，支票也可以。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>挖掘艺术从口袋里摸出了几个大小不一的硬币，共计5磅13先令。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伦纳德叹了一口气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-615301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-615301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-615301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伦纳德：</div><div>先生，在做慈善之前，您还是先为自己买一顿午餐吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>等等，伦纳德，我还能做些什么吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>我能够画海报和涂鸦——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>我的神秘术还能制作肥皂泡，那些泡泡能让人看见美好的未来……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-615301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-615301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-615301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伦纳德：</div><div>很好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>慈善骗子停下了脚步，他的脸上出现了笑容。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-615301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-615301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-615301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伦纳德：</div><div>事实上，我们正在筹划一个慈善晚宴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-615301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-615301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-615301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伦纳德：</div><div>出席这场晚宴的都是些有名的大人物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-615301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-615301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-615301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伦纳德：</div><div>您的泡泡有助于氛围的活跃，我想，如果能让那些先生太太们开心些，那他们捐款的数额也会增多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-615301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-615301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-615301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伦纳德：</div><div>当然，我们也会给出相应的报酬……您觉得50磅怎么样？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>什么？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>不，我不会同意的——您或许不知道，那些特权阶级，他们才是战争真正的发起人！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>他们通过战争赚足了黄金与美钞，随后又以这些所谓的慈善活动来合理避税——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>我的肥皂泡绝不是供他们享乐的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伦纳德冷冷地笑了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-615301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-615301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-615301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伦纳德：</div><div>我看你是得了失心疯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>说完，他大跨步地离开了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>噢……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-kanabijie2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"kanabijie2\"><img alt=\"kanabijie2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-kanabijie2.png/600px-Cg-kanabijie2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-kanabijie2.png/900px-Cg-kanabijie2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-kanabijie2.png/1200px-Cg-kanabijie2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>艺术家漫无目的地游荡在卡纳比街上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>嗯？这家速食店不是已经倒闭了吗……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>还有这些海报……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>接连而至的异象引起了他的警觉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>艺术家数出了几个硬币，拦下了正在售卖报纸的报童。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>一份报纸，谢谢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>略过无数耸人听闻的标题，他很快找到了报纸发行的日期。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306410.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-306410.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306410.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306410.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-306410.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306410.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-306410.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306410.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>……啊？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306410.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-306410.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306410.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306410.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-306410.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306410.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-306410.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306410.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>现在是……1966年2月7日？</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "FP-06"}}